      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "For more information about the parameters, see [`AudioUnitParameterID`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AudioToolbox/AudioUnitParameterID), [`AudioUnitScope`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AudioToolbox/AudioUnitScope), and [`AudioUnitElement`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AudioToolbox/AudioUnitElement).",
